    "detailed_description": "Pixel Tank is a really simple game.<br />\r\nIt's a pixelated fish tank!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse it to relax or as ambiance in the background of your work day or even while you sleep!<br />\r\nEvery minute in game you gain a coin. You can use those coins to unlock any fish you want in the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's like Pixelated ASMR!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPixel Tank features 24 different fish and creatures you can populate your tank with and no limit of how many of each you can add in.<br />\r\nThe possibilities are endless.  Will you fill your tank with comfy fish or maybe something more flashy like a rainbow flashing fish?<br />\r\nAll in glorious 16 bit graphics to give you that nostalgic feel.",
